238 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Markets don\031t make decisions\054 people do\056 And what guides them often isn\031t\240just\240data\054 but\240desire\056\n\nSelf\055reflective AI\240invites\240foundational clarity\054 helping leaders anchor strategy in purpose\056\nExternal\055facing AI\240prioritizes\240signal detection\054 keeping attention on what the world is doing \024 and what works\056\n\nThis is a tension between\240values\055first alignment and data\055first adaptation\056\n\050The former is essential when the stakes are identity\055shaping\056 The latter is vital when agility and responsiveness matter most\056)
     /K [ 3 ]
     /P 239 0 R
